      "message": "The encoder performance results are given below (patchset 1 wrt commit# 446d160a742feed92ebe4401a0070f5f843aeda2). We rebased the patch to latest version to avoid merge conflict in speed_features.c (patchset 2).\n  \n```\n     \t\tInstruction Count                BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution   Reduction(%)   avg.psnr   ovr.psnr   ssim     vmaf    vmaf_neg \n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n  1      LOWRES2     2.267 \t   0.0419     0.0451   0.0759   0.0320    0.0185 \n  1      MIDRES2     1.930 \t   0.0327     0.0305   0.0394   0.0402    0.0224 \n  1   SHORTS608P     2.294 \t  -0.0156    -0.0172  -0.0008  -0.1082   -0.0495 \n  1   SHORTS720P     2.027 \t   0.0109     0.0141   0.0093   0.0378    0.0321 \n  1  SHORTS1080P     1.725 \t   0.0088     0.0101   0.0136  -0.0096    0.0032 \n  1       HDRES2     2.698 \t  -0.0123    -0.0121   0.0164   0.0132    0.0079 \n  1   \t Average     2.144 \t   0.0102     0.0109   0.0240  -0.0016    0.0048 \n```         \n\n The instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n \n``` \n $ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc\n``` \n\n Please review.",
